1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:04,684
A real eighteen hole golf course is part
of this Las Vegas Strip resort.

2
00:00:04,814 --> 00:00:10,626
This is Wynn Las Vegas, a five star luxury
resort on the Strip, rated nine point

3
00:00:10,656 --> 00:00:12,598
four out of ten on Expedia.

4
00:00:12,758 --> 00:00:16,788
Thirteen restaurants, three outdoor pools,
and a full service spa, all in one place.

5
00:00:16,918 --> 00:00:20,224
Here is how I would plan your stay, and my
honest score comes at the end.

6
00:00:20,354 --> 00:00:21,924
Start with your room.

7
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:27,926
There are two thousand seven hundred
fourteen rooms, and the standard rooms
start at

8
00:00:27,956 --> 00:00:29,846
six hundred forty square feet.

9
00:00:29,976 --> 00:00:34,749
Every room has twenty-four hour room
service, a fifty-five inch TV, and a
bathroom

10
00:00:34,779 --> 00:00:36,565
with a separate tub and shower.

11
00:00:36,695 --> 00:00:41,876
Ask for a panoramic view king room, which
guests score nine point eight out of ten.

12
00:00:42,006 --> 00:00:46,026
Want more space? The biggest suite is more
than two thousand square feet.

13
00:00:46,156 --> 00:00:47,672
Now, the outdoor fun.

14
00:00:47,802 --> 00:00:53,063
There are three outdoor pools with
cabanas, sun loungers, and a lifeguard on
site.

15
00:00:53,193 --> 00:00:57,486
At the adults only pool, bartenders craft
cocktails while music plays.

16
00:00:57,616 --> 00:01:01,905
One hundred thirty five guest reviews
praise the pool as beautiful and very well

17
00:01:01,935 --> 00:01:02,175
kept.

18
00:01:02,305 --> 00:01:06,456
And then there is the golf course, with
caddies, golf carts, and a pro shop.

19
00:01:06,586 --> 00:01:07,370
Now, food.

20
00:01:07,716 --> 00:01:12,405
There are thirteen restaurants, two coffee
shops, and seven bars and lounges.

21
00:01:12,535 --> 00:01:18,244
Named spots include Mizumi, SW Steakhouse,
Delilah, and Tableau, plus Charlie's

22
00:01:18,274 --> 00:01:19,043
Sports Bar.

23
00:01:19,173 --> 00:01:22,835
Three hundred seventy four guest reviews
say the restaurants are excellent.

24
00:01:22,965 --> 00:01:24,184
Then book the spa.

25
00:01:24,314 --> 00:01:28,714
It has thirty seven treatment rooms, with
a sauna, a steam room, and couples

26
00:01:28,744 --> 00:01:29,647
treatment rooms.

27
00:01:29,777 --> 00:01:34,114
Facials, massages, and body wraps are on
the menu, and it is open daily.

28
00:01:34,244 --> 00:01:37,227
The health club also offers fitness
classes and yoga.

29
00:01:37,357 --> 00:01:39,516
You are right on the Las Vegas Strip.

30
00:01:39,646 --> 00:01:41,613
Fashion Show Mall is a two minute walk.

31
00:01:41,743 --> 00:01:45,743
Treasure Island and the Venetian gondolas
are eight minutes on foot, and the

32
00:01:45,773 --> 00:01:46,963
Venetian itself is ten.

33
00:01:47,093 --> 00:01:49,197
The airport is a seventeen minute drive.

34
00:01:49,327 --> 00:01:51,379
A few tips to enjoy it even more.

35
00:01:51,509 --> 00:01:57,099
Parking is not free: covered self parking
is twenty five US dollars a day, and valet

36
00:01:57,129 --> 00:01:57,701
is forty.

37
00:01:57,831 --> 00:02:00,222
Internet in the rooms comes with a
surcharge.

38
00:02:00,352 --> 00:02:05,627
The minimum check in age is twenty one,
and early check in or late check out costs
a

39
00:02:05,657 --> 00:02:06,890
fee, when available.

40
00:02:07,020 --> 00:02:11,690
A few recent guests were unhappy with the
service, so speak up early if something is

41
00:02:11,720 --> 00:02:12,249
not right.

42
00:02:12,379 --> 00:02:14,314
So, is Wynn Las Vegas worth it?

43
00:02:14,444 --> 00:02:19,760
On Expedia, guests give it nine point four
out of ten, from more than ten thousand

44
00:02:19,790 --> 00:02:20,282
reviews.

45
00:02:20,412 --> 00:02:25,734
Cleanliness scores nine point eight,
amenities nine point six, and staff and
service

46
00:02:25,764 --> 00:02:26,754
nine point four.

47
00:02:26,884 --> 00:02:28,773
My honest score is nine out of ten.

48
00:02:28,903 --> 00:02:33,880
It is a great pick for couples and friends
who want a luxury stay on the Strip, with

49
00:02:33,910 --> 00:02:35,132
great food and a spa.

50
00:02:35,262 --> 00:02:37,546
The link is in the description.
